  "name": "Inspire Heroics",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A bard of 15th level or higher can inspire tremendous heroism in himself or a single ally within 30 feet. For every three bard levels the character attains beyond 15th, he can inspire heroics in one additional creature. Inspired creatures gain a +4 morale bonus on saving throws and a +4 dodge bonus to AC. Inspire heroics is a mind-affecting ability that relies on audible and visual components.</p>",
